---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 5, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service · Viva Wellness Co."
  description="The terms that govern your use of vivawellnessco.com, including membership policies, medical disclaimers, and how clinical care is established."
>

  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container legal-hero__inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Terms</span>
      <h1 class="legal-hero__title">
        How this <span class="italic-display">works.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        The terms that govern your use of this website and our memberships.
        Plain language, short paragraphs, no surprises.
      </p>
      <p class="legal-hero__updated">Last updated · {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-body">
    <div class="container legal-body__inner">

      <div class="legal-callout">
        <strong>The short version.</strong>
        This website is informational. Visiting it does not create a patient
        relationship. The first visit is $199 with a $50 booking deposit.
        Ongoing memberships have a twelve-week minimum and may be cancelled
        after that initial term under the policies below.
      </div>

      <h2 class="legal-h">By using this site, you agree</h2>
      <p>
        You are eighteen years or older. You are using this website for
        personal, non-commercial purposes. You will not attempt to disrupt the
        site, scrape it at scale, or use it in any way that violates law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">This website is not medical advice</h2>
      <p>
        Everything on this site, including the anonymous care-path guide and
        the blog, is educational. Reading any of it does
        <strong>not</strong> establish a doctor-patient or
        provider-patient relationship. It is not a substitute for individual
        clinical evaluation.
      </p>
      <p>
        Clinical care begins when you book a telehealth visit, complete intake,
        and the provider accepts you as a patient. From that point forward, all
        clinical communication happens in our patient portal (Charm Health),
        not on this website or in generic email.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Memberships</h2>
      <p>
        Membership tiers, what they include, and our cancellation policy are
        listed in detail on the <a href="/services/">care and pricing</a> page. The key
        points:
      </p>
      <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>All memberships require a twelve-week minimum. This is a billing term, not a promise that a result will occur within twelve weeks.</li>
        <li>After the initial twelve weeks, you can cancel any time with no penalty.</li>
        <li>Memberships renew automatically every thirty days. You can update or remove your card on file at any point.</li>
        <li>Medication, supplies, delivery, and labs are included only where the selected membership expressly lists them and only when clinically appropriate.</li>
        <li>We accept FSA and HSA. Insurance is not applied to membership fees but may apply to labs and non-compounded medications.</li>
        <li>Every treatment requires provider review and approval. We do not dispense based on a checkbox.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Provider licensure and service area</h2>
      <p>
        Viva Wellness Co. is a one-hundred-percent telehealth practice operated
        by licensed providers. We currently see patients in Texas, Colorado,
        Florida, and Iowa. If you are physically located in a state where our
        providers are not licensed at the time of a visit, that visit cannot
        proceed.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Medication sourcing</h2>
      <p>
        When prescribed, compounded medications are dispensed by a pharmacy
        operating under Section 503A of the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic
        Act. Compounded drugs are not FDA-approved, and FDA does not review
        their safety, effectiveness, or quality before dispensing. FDA also
        does not approve or license pharmacies. Patients should ask which pharmacy
        would dispense a prescription and review available product-specific
        information before deciding. A membership selection never guarantees a
        prescription, and an FDA-approved option may be considered when available
        and appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Booking and payment</h2>
      <p>
        The first visit costs $199. A $50 deposit is collected when booking and
        is applied to that visit. Appointment changes, late arrivals, refunds,
        and payment processing may also be governed by the policies displayed
        in the GlossGenius booking flow and the clinical or financial documents
        presented during intake. Review those terms before completing payment.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on this site, including text, images, articles, and the
        Viva Wellness Co. wordmark, is our property or licensed to us. Personal
        reading and reasonable sharing is encouraged. Republishing without
        attribution or commercial use without written permission is not.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        This website is provided as-is. While we keep it accurate, we make no
        warranty that it is error-free or always available. To the extent
        permitted by law, our liability for any issue arising from your use of
        this website is limited to the amount you paid to access it, which for
        this website is zero. Clinical care under an active membership is
        separately governed by the documents you sign at intake.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website is not monitored for urgent clinical needs. Call 911 or go
        to the nearest emergency department for an emergency. Existing patients
        should use the patient portal for non-emergency clinical communication.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms. When we do, we will revise the date at the
        top. Continued use of the site after an update means you accept the
        revised terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas. Any dispute
        that cannot be resolved by ordinary conversation will be handled in the
        courts of Travis County, Texas.
      </p>

      <h2 class="legal-h">Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:info&#64;vivawellnessco.com">info&#64;vivawellnessco.com</a>
        or call <a href="tel:+17372107283">(737) 210-7283</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="legal-foot">
        Viva Wellness Co. · 5900 Balcones Dr #19640, Austin, TX 78731
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: var(--section-pad) 0 3rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .legal-hero__inner { position: relative; max-width: 70ch; }
  .legal-hero__title {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal-hero__updated {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .legal-body { padding: 2rem 0 var(--section-pad); }
  .legal-body__inner { max-width: 70ch; margin: 0 auto; }

  .legal-callout {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--text-primary);
    padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .legal-callout strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .legal-h {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.9rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .legal-body p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-control);
    transition: color 200ms var(--ease), border-color 200ms var(--ease);
  }
  .legal-body a:hover {
    color: var(--surface-inverse-hover);
    border-color: var(--surface-inverse-hover);
  }
  .legal-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal-list li {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal-list li::before {
    content: '·';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .legal-list strong { color: var(--text-primary); }

  .legal-foot {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .legal-hero { padding: 3rem 0 2rem; }
    .legal-hero__title { font-size: var(--text-h1); margin: 0.75rem 0 1.15rem; }
    .legal-body { padding: 1.75rem 0 4rem; }
    .legal-callout { padding: 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
